deliverables/anoma-study-2026-09-19/SYNTHESIS.md:82:The evidence supports Anoma as a serious prior-art baseline and makes the proposed research more precise. It neither establishes that Moriarty has solved these obligations nor that no existing platform can satisfy them with additional application work.
